<!DOCTYPE html>
<html style="overflow-y: hidden;">
<head>
	<title>Qantas Reimbursement</title>
</head>
<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">
<p><strong>Reference no:</strong> {{{Recovery__c.Parent_Case__c}}}</p>

<p><strong>Case submitted:</strong> {{{Recovery__c.Case_ReceivedDate__c}}}</p>

<p><strong>Reimbursement reason(s):</strong> {{{Recovery__c.Recovery_Reason__c}}}</p>

<p>{{{Recovery__c.Value__c}}}</p>

<hr />
<p>Hi {{{Recovery__c.Contact_First_Name__c}}},</p>

<p>We wanted to let you know that we&rsquo;re still waiting for your nominated bank details, to process your Qantas reimbursement.</p>

<p>To receive your reimbursement, you&rsquo;ll need to provide us with your bank details within the next 15 days or your access link will expire to our secure portal. After this time, you will need to contact us to reactivate the access link.</p>

<p><br />
<strong>How to organise your reimbursement</strong></p>

<p>To process your reimbursement, you will need to provide us with your bank account details using our secure case portal. Visit <a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/support/contact-us/customer-care-feedback-form/update-customer-care-case.html">https://www.qantas.com/au/en/support/contact-us/customer-care-feedback-form/update-customer-care-case.html</a> &nbsp;to commence your reimbursement.&nbsp;<br />
<br />
All customers will receive email notifications about the progress of the claim. If you are a Qantas Frequent Flyer member, you can conveniently track your reimbursement via the request tracker in the Qantas app via &lsquo;Track my cases&rsquo; in Help and Support.</p>

<p><br />
<strong>Need help?</strong></p>

<p>Call us on 13 13 13 (in Australia) or your local <a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/support/contact-us.html">Qantas Office</a>&nbsp;for assistance.</p>

<p>Have your customer care reference number {{{Recovery__c.Parent_Case__c}}} ready to enter.</p>

<p><strong>If you&#39;re suspicious</strong></p>

<p>Not sure something is genuine? Remember, Qantas will never ask you to&nbsp;<u>email</u>&nbsp;your bank account details,&nbsp;credit card, PIN, or passwords.<br />
For more advice and warnings on scams please visit the Qantas scam assistance page -&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/support/contact-us/scam-assistance.html" rel="noreferrer noopener" target="_blank">https://www.qantas.com/au/en/support/contact-us/scam-assistance.html</a></p>
</body>
</html>